/**
 * Alex Brush (SIL Open Font License 1.1), the script face the certificate
 * design uses for the recipient's name.
 *
 * Embedded as base64 rather than linked. The credential page renders the
 * certificate through an <img> tag, and an SVG loaded that way is not allowed
 * to fetch external stylesheets or fonts - a linked font silently falls back
 * to a default serif. The same applies to a downloaded copy opened offline.
 *
 * 66KB of font becomes ~88KB of base64 in every certificate
 * response. Only this one face is embedded, for that reason: the rest of the
 * design uses widely installed families, named with fallbacks.
 */

